# Single source of truth for non-npm tool versions. Sourced by Makefile, scripts and CI.
# Bump deliberately; record the reason in the PR. (KEY=value, no spaces, no quotes.)
GO_TOOLCHAIN=go1.27.3
GOLANGCI_LINT_VERSION=v2.15.0
GO_ARCH_LINT_VERSION=v1.19.0
GOVULNCHECK_VERSION=v1.9.0
DEADCODE_VERSION=v0.52.0
SQLC_VERSION=v1.31.1
OAPI_CODEGEN_VERSION=v2.8.1
OASDIFF_VERSION=v1.34.1
# Downloaded binaries are verified against these sha256 pins (per OS/arch) before install; a re-tagged
# release fails the install. At every bump, check each new pin against upstream's checksums (Trivy: the
# release's checksums.txt and its cosign signature) and record that in the PR (exec plan 0003, Q1).
# Atlas community edition: `migrate lint` is Pro-only in the official build since v0.38.
ATLAS_VERSION=v1.3.0
ATLAS_SHA256_DARWIN_ARM64=4e5ffdc10b2b4fd3a06074aba72848150907d5316cacad7b19bae6c6ae3db991
